# Wren Hollow, for the actor commands: the tallykeeper stands behind its counter (its talk point's actor_at), the
# sentinel wears a field enemy's figure and stands solid without fighting, and the drifter is placed, routed,
# animated and removed by the scene. The second talk shows the drifter again after the area reloaded, removes the
# tallykeeper for good and reloads the area.

event hollow_keeper unskippable
	lock player
	if hollow.met
		say tallykeeper @hollow.keeper.again
		anim hollow_drifter fade_in
		place hollow_drifter 6 0 5 facing north
		move hollow_drifter to shelf_front nowait
		face tallykeeper east
		sync
		anim hollow_drifter blink_out
		anim tallykeeper fade_out
		remove tallykeeper
		unlock player
		warp wren_hollow hollow_door
		return
	end
	say tallykeeper @hollow.keeper.hello
	face tallykeeper west
	face tallykeeper south
	place hollow_drifter west_post facing east
	anim hollow_drifter fade_in
	say tallykeeper @hollow.keeper.drifter
	move hollow_drifter to east_post pathfind
	anim hollow_drifter hop
	face hollow_drifter tallykeeper
	move hollow_drifter via shelf_front to west_post speed 2
	anim hollow_drifter dissolve
	say tallykeeper @hollow.keeper.gone
	remove hollow_drifter until reload
	anim tallykeeper tally_nod
	anim tallykeeper shake
	set hollow.met
	unlock player
end
